              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Drgnfly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I make this dressing for my Asian chicken salad. I use brown sugar instead of white and red wine vinegar instead of Apple cider vinegar.\nSalad with teriyaki grilled chicken, iceberg lettuce, finely chopped purple onion, dry ramen noodle (finely broken up) and sunflower seeds.",
