              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Samantha Yauger"
            },
            "reviewBody": "After using the original recipe I ended up using 1 1/2 Tablespoons of Worchestershire sauce and no onions because my husband doesn't like onions but he loved this dressing!",
            "datePublished": "2015-07-12T20:46:40.343Z"
