            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Glenda B"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe with lots of flavor! I used olive oil instead of vegetable oil since its better for you. I think I would cut back on the onion just a little if you don't like having that onion taste in your mouth an hour later. I did not have time to put my dressing in the refrigerator for an hour so I blended it with my hand held blender. This gave it a smooth frothy look and might explain why mine tasted so oniony. Anyway, great recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2008-03-15T13:03:24.867Z"
