            "reviewBody": "I think the recipe is great as it is, however just to let you know that I made the following changes because I had to, and it still turned out great.\nI used brown sugar instead of white, and it worked well with the apple cider vinegar. I didn't have an onion so I had to omit it, but it was still good. I used a combination of mostly olive oil, some vegetable oil, and a dash of roasted garlic oil. This is a very versatile recipe. Thanks for sharing.",
